What is the output of the following Java program?
```java
class Calculator {
    private int factor = 3;

    public int compute(int x) {
        return step(x) * factor;
    }

    private int step(int x) {
        return x + 2;
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Calculator calc = new Calculator();
        System.out.println(calc.compute(4));
    }
}
```

What does the following Java program print?
```java
abstract class Processor {
    final void process() {
        init();
        execute();
    }
    abstract void init();
    abstract void execute();
}

class FastProcessor extends Processor {
    void init() {
        System.out.print("I-");
    }
    void execute() {
        System.out.print("E");
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Processor p = new FastProcessor();
        p.process();
    }
}
```

What is the output of the following Java program?
